    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n75667" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀσφρ-αντικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>capable of smelling, quick of scent</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[κυνίδια</span>] <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>GA</u>
				781b10
			</span></i>; of the vine, <i>sensitive to odours</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>CP</u>
				2.18.4
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ ὀ. αἰσθητήριον</span> the organ
				<i>of the sense of smell</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>de An.</u>
				421b32
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ ὀσφραντικόν</span>
			<i>the capacity of smelling</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὃ
				ἐνεργείᾳ ἡ ὄσφρησις, τοῦτο δυνάμει τὸ ὀ</span>.
				<i><span class="en">
				<u>Sens.</u>
				438b22
			</span></i>.</div>
